  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future Climate Resilient Cereals Innovational Lab (CRCIL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRCL aims to design, lead, and implement a research program focused on the discovery/identification of novel alleles for traits critical in climate adaptation, validate and transfer to elite lines of rice, wheat, sorghum and millet in FTF countries and adjacent areas with similar farming systems.</narrative>
  </description>
